# Artefacts (main run)
Run: `python3 analysis/roles_requirements_share.py`  (deterministic: seed=42, B=10,000)

* `roles_requirements_share.py` - full pipeline: load -> sentinel audit -> base construction
  -> M1/M2 metrics -> bootstrap (percentile + BCa + SE + normal) -> sensitivity grid -> diagnostics.
* `main_table_Q8_valid194_M1.csv` - 8 roles x (rank, k, n, %, boot SE, percentile CI, BCa CI, normal CI).
* `sensitivity_4bases_x_2metrics.csv` - 4 denominators x 2 metrics x 8 roles.
* `sensitivity_top_ranks_summary.csv` - rank1/rank2/rank3 + gap per base x metric.
* `paired_bootstrap_contrasts.csv` - PL vs DS, DS vs BA, PL vs BA (paired, same resamples).
* `sensitivity_arbitrary_others_mapping.csv` - ARBITRARY keyword mapping of D4_Role_Others (not used).
* `d14_association_rule_learning_by_role_NOT_the_answer.csv` - association-rule-learning reading.
* `audit_and_diagnostics.json` - shape/ID/status/role counts, sentinel inventory, Q8 structure,
  feasibility check of the 49.6% / 61.389% numbers, paired contrasts.
* `hypothesis.md` - answer + disclaimers.
`work/` holds the exploratory inspection scripts that produced the plan.
